tm⇇
	⎕systemInfo→os≡'mingw32'⍰"{int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int}"⍠
	                         "{int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,int,long,str}"⋄
LocalTime⇇⊐(⎕FFI ("*"⍪tm)‿"localtime"‿"*u64") ⍝ u64 is probably large enough to cover all possible sizes of time_t

tmNamed⇇
	⎕systemInfo→os≡'mingw32'⍰"⦃sec←int,min←int,hour←int,mday←int,mon←int,year←int,wday←int,yday←int,isdst←int⦄"⍠
	                         "⦃sec←int,min←int,hour←int,mday←int,mon←int,year←int,wday←int,yday←int,isdst←int,offset←long,zone←str⦄"⋄
LocalTimeNamed⇇⊐(⎕FFI ("*"⍪tmNamed)‿"localtime"‿"*u64")

now←'u64'⎕ffi→New⌊⎕unix ⋄
⎕←⊃(LocalTime now)→Peek 0 ⋄
⎕←⊃(LocalTimeNamed now)→Peek 0 ⋄
⎕ffi→Free now
